      "start_seconds": 1.05,
      "end_seconds": 2.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "good afternoon, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.64,
      "end_seconds": 11.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "yes, come in and sit down what brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 12.44,
      "end_seconds": 17.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "Good morning, uh, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.21,
      "end_seconds": 23.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "of course please stay it's helpful to have you here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.47,
      "end_seconds": 29.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "well, I've been having weakness in the legs"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.56,
      "end_seconds": 33.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.74,
      "end_seconds": 43.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.28,
      "text": "Ever since... since last Tuesday, really. I didn't wanna bother you but it keeps coming back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.25,
      "end_seconds": 47.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. What about severe back pain have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.08,
      "end_seconds": 61.14,
      "duration_seconds": 12.06,
      "text": "yeah, uh, that too as for fever, I honestly can't say when that began it might have been last month or the month before"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.23,
      "end_seconds": 65.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "right, did you notice any chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.44,
      "end_seconds": 69.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed no chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.52,
      "end_seconds": 75.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Did you get recent fall or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.44,
      "end_seconds": 80.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "no no recent fall or weight loss"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.6,
      "end_seconds": 85.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "so, any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.88,
      "end_seconds": 89.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "no skin's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.06,
      "end_seconds": 92.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.76,
      "end_seconds": 95.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.17,
      "end_seconds": 100.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.97,
      "end_seconds": 108.59,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "yes diabetes it's a relief to to finally sit down and talk about it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.1,
      "end_seconds": 118.73,
      "duration_seconds": 7.63,
      "text": "yes, diabetes is known to us, good to have that clear. Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.82,
      "end_seconds": 123.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.19,
      "end_seconds": 127.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "What line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.25,
      "end_seconds": 134.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.72,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.64,
      "end_seconds": 138.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Right, who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.47,
      "end_seconds": 142.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "My partner and our baby"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.54,
      "end_seconds": 154.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "right, any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.43,
      "end_seconds": 161.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Just a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.1,
      "end_seconds": 167.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "So, what do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.14,
      "end_seconds": 175.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "I'm on glibenclamide, 5 milligrams, before breakfast for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.76,
      "end_seconds": 180.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Since when have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.46,
      "end_seconds": 183.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "about about a month"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.72,
      "end_seconds": 187.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.24,
      "end_seconds": 202.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.57,
      "end_seconds": 228.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "okay: pressure 123 over 66, temperature 38.7, heart rate 107."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.09,
      "end_seconds": 234.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "now I'm going to do a short physical check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.46,
      "end_seconds": 239.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Alright, tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.76,
      "end_seconds": 264.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "your spine is extremely tender at one level and your leg strength is reduced"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.28,
      "end_seconds": 272.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.39,
      "end_seconds": 293.96,
      "duration_seconds": 11.57,
      "text": "so where does that leave us? It fits best with a possible spinal infection pressing on the nerves. Another possibility is a slipped disc"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.67,
      "end_seconds": 297.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "is this serious doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.86,
      "end_seconds": 311.37,
      "duration_seconds": 9.51,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a a possible spinal infection pressing on the nerves do well once it's treated properly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.8,
      "end_seconds": 353.56,
      "duration_seconds": 31.76,
      "text": "I think an urgent MRI of the spine makes sense here, for possible epidural abscess you are going to hospital now, this can cause permanent weakness avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us the spinal team would be the right next step, I'll refer you the thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse if that happens, go to emergency i'd like you back straight away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.5,
      "end_seconds": 358.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "I'll book it on my way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.95,
      "end_seconds": 365.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "right, that's the the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.51,
      "end_seconds": 371.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "hmm no that's all. Thanks a lot"
    }
  ]
}